---
import LeadFormIsland from "./LeadFormIsland";
---

<section class="bg-[#fffaf3] px-5 py-14 sm:py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-[0.95fr_0.72fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="brand-eyebrow">Next step</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-[#1c1917] md:text-5xl">
        Get a local plan before you make a move.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-[#4f4942] sm:text-lg sm:leading-8">
        Tell Joel what you are trying to accomplish. The site will route the request through the owned lead intake path first, then into the correct follow-up workflow.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#e3d8ca] bg-white/74 p-4 shadow-[0_12px_34px_rgba(28,25,23,0.07)]">
        <img
          src="/brand/logos/robertson-seal-light.webp"
          alt="Robertson Real Estate Saint George Utah seal"
          class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1c1917]">Robertson Real Estate</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#6f665d]">Opening Doors. Creating Opportunities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="grid gap-4">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-[#e3d8ca] bg-white shadow-[0_18px_50px_rgba(28,25,23,0.08)]">
        <img
          src="/brand/portfolio/client-success-thumbs-up.webp"
          alt="Happy real estate clients after a successful move"
          class="h-44 w-full object-cover object-center sm:h-52 md:h-44"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="p-5">
          <p class="brand-eyebrow">Client support</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#4f4942]">
            Practical guidance before, during, and after the move.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <LeadFormIsland client:visible intent="general_contact" />
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
